From: Amphoze <184834775+Amphoze@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] context: tests of a kept answer's lifetime and of every
 sender of a statement

Tests only. A disk entry is bounded by the time inside its sealed answer as well as by its
file time; a memory entry by elapsed time, whatever the wall clock does; an answer must name
the project asked about in its ref and in its address; one member's refusal is that
member's alone. Every function that sends a statement or a type-generation request names
the request's project whatever headers, ref or connection string a caller hands in, and
sends nothing outside a request.
---
